              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka cwec aŋwen no jodwoko ni, “Ameno!” To jodongo no jogore piny kareno jolamo Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
